---
title: "mint - Supply to Lending Pool (Scallop Lending)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version_check: check version matches
    q_version_check --> q_validate_market: version valid
    q_version_check --> q_error_version: version mismatch
    q_error_version --> [*]: revert 73729

    q_validate_market --> q_check_active: load market state
    q_check_active --> q_check_cap: market is active
    q_check_active --> q_error_inactive: market not active
    q_error_inactive --> [*]: revert 73729

    q_check_cap --> q_accrue_interest: supply + coin.value <= supply_cap
    q_check_cap --> q_error_cap: supply limit reached
    q_error_cap --> [*]: revert 81922

    q_accrue_interest --> q_calc_exchange: compound_interest(market, clock)
    q_calc_exchange --> q_calc_mint: exchange_rate = total_supply / total_market_coin
    q_calc_mint --> q_deposit: mint_amount = coin.value / exchange_rate
    q_deposit --> q_update_pool: pool.total_supply += coin.value
    q_update_pool --> q_mint_scoin: pool.total_market_coin += mint_amount
    q_mint_scoin --> q_emit: create Coin of MarketCoin with mint_amount
    q_emit --> [*]: emit MintEvent, return MarketCoin

    note right of q_calc_exchange
        INV-001: exchange_rate >= 1.0 (monotonically increasing)
        INV-002: total_supply / total_market_coin is always well-defined (no division by zero when pool non-empty)
        INV-003: mint_amount > 0 when coin.value > 0
    end note

    note right of q_deposit
        INV-004: pool.total_supply after = pool.total_supply before + coin.value
        INV-005: pool.total_market_coin after = pool.total_market_coin before + mint_amount
    end note
